<title>USA: Whitney Holding acquires Merchants.</title>
<headline>Whitney Holding acquires Merchants.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whitney Holding Corp said Friday it has completed its acquisition of Merchants Bancshares Inc.</p>
<p>The terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Merchants, said the company, has assets of $208 million and 13 locations in Harrison and Hancock counties in Mississippi.</p>
<p>Whitney said it now operates over 100 banking locations in Louisiana, Mississippi, Alabama and Florida.</p>
</text>
